2. **No Commercial Exploitation or Paywalls:** You may NOT sell, rent, lease, sub-license, monetarily monetize, gate behind paywalls (e.g., Patreon, Boosty, ad-links, paid downloads), or bundle the Software into commercial products.
3. **No Plagiarism or Clone Distribution:** You may NOT strip copyright notices, rebrand, or republish the Software or modified forks thereof as a separate or competing UI framework without prior written consent.

